      "MARKET CHECKOUT LADY: Eight dollars has been added to Jack’s account.\nALICE: Thank you so much.",
      "SHELLEY ALICE: Alice, welcome! You look Are you kidding me? This wonderful. dress--\nSHELLEY: Frank, look at her, she’s glowing.\nSHELLEY: Is this glow due to any particular reason?\nALICE: Just general happiness, I think.",
      "BUNNY: Is she awake?\nBUNNY: Look who decided to join the land of the living. I heard you hit the sauce last night!\nALICE: It’s what I get for trying to keep up with y--\nALICE: No...",
      "BUNNY: What?!\nALICE: You didn’t see...\nALICE: I’m sorry. I had a really weird night. I think it was a migraine, or something. And I thought I saw... Sorry.\nBUNNY: Don’t lie to us. You’re having an affair with the bus driver.",
      "MARKET CHECKOUT LADY: Anything I can help you with?\nALICE: Where does this come from?\nMARKET CHECKOUT LADY: The produce aisle.\nALICE: No, where does it actually come from?"
    ]
